WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.572
We produce fundraisers for South Florida
nonprofits.

00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:07.078
Our team brings years of event experience

00:00:07.089 --> 00:00:10.943
to planning, sponsor outreach, vendor
logistics,

00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:12.426
and running the day.

00:00:12.438 --> 00:00:16.112
We use one management system to keep your
team connected

00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:18.910
from the first invitation to check-in.

00:00:18.921 --> 00:00:21.820
Keep using it year-round to accept
donations,

00:00:21.831 --> 00:00:25.640
recruit volunteers, and offer sponsorship
packages.

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:27.438
We can even develop a mobile app

00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:29.831
for your organization at no cost.

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:36.630
That’s Cause on Cue, our 2027 program.

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:39.461
Tell us about the fundraiser you want to
produce.
